{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Publicación de bloques y puentes",
    "output": "docs/diagramas/publicacion.html",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "borrador",
        "label": "Borrador",
        "focus": [
          "codigo",
          "puente_draft"
        ],
        "note": "El bloque es una función export default (input, ctx); el puente la instancia con config y refs $."
      },
      {
        "id": "puertas",
        "label": "Puertas al publicar",
        "focus": [
          "puente_draft",
          "transpile",
          "schemas",
          "error422",
          "dryrun"
        ],
        "note": "Transpile swc, schemas estrictos y dry-run con mocks: los errores se ven antes de crear versión."
      },
      {
        "id": "inmutabilidad",
        "label": "Versión inmutable",
        "focus": [
          "dryrun",
          "version",
          "rollback"
        ],
        "note": "Publicar crea una versión única con el JS compilado; revertir es re-publicar, jamás reescribir."
      }
    ]
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "autor",
      "label": "Autoría"
    },
    {
      "id": "validacion",
      "label": "Validación al publicar"
    },
    {
      "id": "runtime",
      "label": "Catálogo versionado"
    },
    {
      "id": "excepciones",
      "label": "Corrección",
      "variant": "exception"
    }
  ],
  "phases": [
    {
      "id": "borrador",
      "label": "Borrador",
      "fromCol": 0,
      "toCol": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "validar",
      "label": "Validar",
      "fromCol": 2,
      "toCol": 3,
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "publicar",
      "label": "Publicar",
      "fromCol": 4,
      "toCol": 5,
      "variant": "dashed"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "codigo",
    "puente_draft",
    "transpile",
    "schemas",
    "dryrun",
    "version"
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "codigo",
      "lane": "autor",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Código del bloque",
      "sublabel": "(input, ctx) → salida",
      "tag": "TS o JS",
      "width": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "puente_draft",
      "lane": "autor",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Puente borrador",
      "sublabel": "instancias + refs $.",
      "width": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "transpile",
      "lane": "validacion",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "Transpile swc",
      "sublabel": "TS → JS al publicar",
      "tag": "nunca en runtime",
      "width": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "schemas",
      "lane": "validacion",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "Schemas + ui",
      "sublabel": "input/output/config",
      "tag": "subconjunto estricto",
      "width": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "dryrun",
      "lane": "validacion",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "Dry-run",
      "sublabel": "mocks por instancia",
      "tag": "sin IO real",
      "width": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "version",
      "lane": "runtime",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "Versión inmutable",
      "sublabel": "UNIQUE(block, version)",
      "tag": "latest_version",
      "width": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "error422",
      "lane": "excepciones",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "Rechazada · 422",
      "sublabel": "Problem Details",
      "tag": "sin versión creada",
      "width": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "rollback",
      "lane": "excepciones",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "messagebus",
      "label": "Rollback",
      "sublabel": "re-publicar versión previa",
      "tag": "el pasado no se reescribe",
      "width": 136
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "codigo-puente",
      "from": "codigo",
      "to": "puente_draft",
      "label": "una instancia por bloque"
    },
    {
      "id": "puente-transpile",
      "from": "puente_draft",
      "to": "transpile",
      "label": "publicar",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "transpile-schemas",
      "from": "transpile",
      "to": "schemas",
      "label": "JS válido"
    },
    {
      "id": "schemas-error",
      "from": "schemas",
      "to": "error422",
      "label": "sintaxis o schema inválido",
      "variant": "security",
      "role": "error"
    },
    {
      "id": "schemas-dryrun",
      "from": "schemas",
      "to": "dryrun",
      "label": "válido"
    },
    {
      "id": "dryrun-version",
      "from": "dryrun",
      "to": "version",
      "label": "confirmar",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "version-rollback",
      "from": "version",
      "to": "rollback",
      "label": "revertir",
      "variant": "security",
      "role": "error"
    },
    {
      "id": "rollback-version",
      "from": "rollback",
      "to": "version",
      "label": "re-publica la versión buena",
      "variant": "dashed",
      "role": "return",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toSide": "bottom"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Inmutabilidad",
      "items": [
        "Cada versión es UNIQUE(block_id, version) y guarda el JS ya compilado",
        "Los puentes referencian bloque + versión exactos, jamás latest a la hora de correr",
        "Revertir no reescribe el pasado: es re-publicar la versión buena"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Puertas al publicar",
      "items": [
        "swc transpila TS → JS solo al publicar; el runtime recibe JS",
        "inputSchema, outputSchema, configSchema y metadatos ui contra el subconjunto estricto",
        "Error de compilación o schema: 422 Problem Details sin crear la versión"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Ensayo antes de volar",
      "items": [
        "Dry-run del borrador con mocks por instancia, sin filas de ejecución",
        "La consola muestra los errores de transpile en línea, junto al código",
        "El puente publicado queda invocable en /x/{slug}"
      ]
    }
  ]
}